<title>ISRAEL: Hyundai Elec weighing Israel R&amp;D centre.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Elec weighing Israel R&amp;D centre.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A delegation of executives from South Korea's Hyundai Electronic Industries Co. will visit Israel to explore setting up a research and development centre, Israel's Industry and Trade Ministry said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the visit followed two years of intensive efforts by Israeli officials to interest the company, which makes communications equipment, semiconductors, computers and information systems.</p>
<p>The ministry did not say when the group was arriving.</p>
<p>- Jerusalem newsroom, 972-2-537-0502</p>
</text>
